Create a deterministic regression jinx for overflow-hidden inline text clipping. The jinx renders a fixture with a 100px red label, a 100px blue overflow:hidden ellipsis span containing long text, and a 100px green After span. It then checks that no blue pixels appear inside the green After region (x=210..290, y=5..35) and that some blue pixels remain visible inside the ellipsis region (x=100..200).